\i0 \cf0 Markal thought for a moment, this was a lot to take in. 
\i This is all amazing stuff, and when I figure out how to explain it to other people without them thinking I\'92m insane, we definitely need to investigate it all, but we need to get back to Eranor. My father\'92s throne is empty, and you can be sure all the wrong people are trying to fill it right now.\
This is the way back. The only way back for you is through. I can get you through the breach to the Aelfin side and we can find a ship to Eranor. Once we\'92re there, a breach in the Ridge will return you to your world again.\
That\'92s insane!\
